local guides={["The Postman Always K.O.s Twice"]={["links"]={{["label"]="Muddy Bar Tab",["title"]="Muddy Bar Tab"},{["label"]="Torn Epistle",["title"]="Torn Epistle"},{["label"]="Odd Postcard",["title"]="Odd Postcard"},{["label"]="Damp Envelope",["title"]="Damp Envelope"},{["label"]="Ambrosius",["title"]="Ambrosius"},{["label"]="Windurst Walls",["title"]="Windurst Walls"}},["images"]={},["localGuide"]=true,["title"]="The Postman Always K.O.s Twice",["text"]="The Postman Always K.O.s Twice\nWindurst quest\n\nStarts with\nAmbrosius\n\nZone\nWindurst Walls\n\nWalkthrough\n\nSpeak to Ambrosius and accept the quest. Trade one or more different letters: Muddy Bar Tab, Torn Epistle, Odd Postcard, or Damp Envelope. Trade them together for the larger reward.\n\nRewards\n\nOne letter: 50 gil. Two different letters: 150 gil. Three: 250 gil. All four: 500 gil.\nFirst completion: 80 Windurst fame. Repeat trades: 5, 15, 25, or 50 fame respectively.\n\nNotes\n\nRepeatable. Gil amounts are multiplied by the server's gil-rate setting.\n\nGenerated from Phoenix server NPC script: scripts/zones/Windurst_Walls/npcs/Ambrosius.lua. Verified October 9, 2026.",["linkSchema"]=2,["preview"]="Return Muddy Bar Tab, Torn Epistle, Odd Postcard, or Damp Envelope to Ambrosius in Windurst Walls. Repeatable."},["Mandragora-Mad"]={["links"]={{["label"]="Cornette",["title"]="Cornette"},{["label"]="Yuhtunga Sulfur",["title"]="Yuhtunga Sulfur"},{["label"]="3-Leaf Mandragora Bud",["title"]="3-Leaf Mandragora Bud"},{["label"]="4-Leaf Mandragora Bud",["title"]="4-Leaf Mandragora Bud"},{["label"]="Snobby Letter",["title"]="Snobby Letter"},{["label"]="Yoran-Oran",["title"]="Yoran-Oran"},{["label"]="Windurst Walls",["title"]="Windurst Walls"}},["images"]={},["localGuide"]=true,["title"]="Mandragora-Mad",["text"]="Mandragora-Mad\nWindurst quest\n\nStarts with\nYoran-Oran\n\nZone\nWindurst Walls\n\nWalkthrough\n\nSpeak to Yoran-Oran to accept the quest. Trade one of the following items. This quest can be repeated.\n\nCornette: 200 gil and 10 Windurst fame.\nYuhtunga Sulfur: 250 gil and 25 Windurst fame.\n3-Leaf Mandragora Bud: 1,200 gil and 50 Windurst fame.\n4-Leaf Mandragora Bud: 120 gil and 10 Windurst fame.\nSnobby Letter: 5,500 gil and 100 Windurst fame.\n\nNotes\n\nGil amounts are multiplied by the server's gil-rate setting.\n\nGenerated from Phoenix server NPC script: scripts/zones/Windurst_Walls/npcs/Yoran-Oran.lua. Verified October 9, 2026.",["linkSchema"]=2,["preview"]="Trade Cornette or other accepted Mandragora items to Yoran-Oran in Windurst Walls. Repeatable."},["The Opo Opo And I"]={["title"]="The Opo Opo And I",["text"]="The Opo Opo And I\n\nWalkthrough\n\nThis is a Phoenix script requirement reference. A full walkthrough is not bundled for this quest. Items can be used at different steps or as alternatives; this list is not a single trade recipe.\n\nInvolved NPCs\n\nLulupp - Kazham\nNenepp - Kazham\n\nRequirements\n\n",["requirements"]={22,483,904,905,1008,1147,1157,1158,4599,4600},["links"]={{["label"]="Kazham",["title"]="Kazham"},{["label"]="Kazham",["title"]="Kazham"}},["images"]={},["localGuide"]=true,["requirementReference"]=true,["linkSchema"]=2,["preview"]="Phoenix script requirement reference. Item turn-ins are recorded for The Opo Opo And I. Click for verified item references and NPC locations.",["sourceText"]="\n\nGenerated from Phoenix public NPC scripts, audited October 9, 2026. scripts/zones/Kazham/npcs/Lulupp.lua; scripts/zones/Kazham/npcs/Nenepp.lua"},["Missionary Man"]={["title"]="Missionary Man",["text"]="Missionary Man\n\nWalkthrough\n\nThis is a Phoenix script requirement reference. A full walkthrough is not bundled for this quest. Items can be used at different steps or as alternatives; this list is not a single trade recipe.\n\nInvolved NPCs\n\nRauteinot - Kazham\n\nRequirements\n\n",["requirements"]={1146},["links"]={{["label"]="Kazham",["title"]="Kazham"}},["images"]={},["localGuide"]=true,["requirementReference"]=true,["linkSchema"