text="Kazham Airship Pass\n\nStarts with: Guddal\nZone: Port Jeuno (I-7)\nRepeatable: No\n\nRequirements\n\nGhelsba Chest Key\n\nPalborough Chest Key\n\nGiddeus Chest Key\n\nWalkthrough\n\nTalk to Guddal at the Kazham airship dock in Port Jeuno. Trade all three keys together, one of each, with no gil. Alternatively, his dialogue offers the pass for 148,000 gil.\n\nRewards\n\nAirship pass for Kazham\n\nNotes\n\nThis task does not appear in the quest log. QuestLens detects completion by reading the locally held airship pass for Kazham key item.\n\nSource and attribution\n\nPhoenix public NPC script: scripts/zones/Port_Jeuno/npcs/Guddal.lua; cached October 9, 2026. Wiki guides may describe later-era features unavailable on Phoenix.",
